<h1>Allocation rules</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Cost that carries no team of its own - untagged usage, commitment
purchases, tax, credits - is redistributed onto teams by an explicit model, the way
the Allocation capability prescribes: proportional to usage, evenly, or by declared
weights. A pool with no basis stays unsplit and says why. Changing a rule changes the
numbers everywhere, including each figure's qid.</p>



